    "m04.bookerbob.testnet": "cozy gamer hoodie built for long sessions, share your steam account age and verified perks to unlock loyalty rewards",
    "m05.bookerbob.testnet": "commuter hoodie built for daily rides, soft layers for airport waits and late coding nights, loyalty perks welcome here.",
    "m06.bookerbob.testnet": "verified claude spender and real human, this hoodie is your uniform for hackathons and airport lounges alike.",
    "m07.bookerbob.testnet": "premium heavyweight cotton hoodie built for frequent travelers who value lasting quality over markdowns, made for discerning buyers.",
    "m08.bookerbob.testnet": "verified human via world id unlocks your hoodie deal now, claim it before stock runs out.",
    "m09.bookerbob.testnet": "verified on all three badges, so stack every matched line and grab this hoodie at your deepest total cut.",
    "m10.bookerbob.testnet": "verified traveler, builder, and human: stack all three hoodie discounts before the tight cap closes today.",
    "m11.bookerbob.testnet": "packable hoodie for long layovers and cold guesthouses, your verified airbnb frequent status earns the matched discount line.",
    "m12.bookerbob.testnet": "verified human with premium taste, this hoodie drop fits your always moving lifestyle, grab yours before it sells out",
    "m13.bookerbob.testnet": "verified humans unlock our deepest hoodie perk, frequent travelers stack extra savings, organic cotton made people and planet first.",
    "m14.bookerbob.testnet": "verified human builder, your claude spender status unlocks our deepest hoodie discount, board shows the number, claim it.",
    "m15.bookerbob.testnet": "frequent flyer comfort: soft hoodie for cold cabins and late arrivals, your loyalty perk applies at checkout.",
    "m16.bookerbob.testnet": "verified traveler and ai power user, our cozy hoodie suits your airport runs and late night coding sessions alike.",
    "m17.bookerbob.testnet": "your airbnb, claude, and world id badges each stack loyalty rewards on this hoodie, triple little wins.",
    "m18.bookerbob.testnet": "verified human and claude devotee, this boutique hoodie suits your travels, your matched offer awaits on the board.",
    "m19.bookerbob.testnet": "verified human, claude loyalist, always traveling: both your hoodie discount lines stack on the board, claim them now.",
    "m20.bookerbob.testnet": "trail tested hoodie built for cold layovers and summit winds, and your frequent traveler status unlocks our deepest posted discount.",
    "m21.bookerbob.testnet": "verified traveler and late night builder, this hoodie keeps you warm through code sessions and wherever you land next.",
    "m22.bookerbob.testnet": "genuine vintage hoodie for a verified traveler, preloved softness no new fleece can fake, pack it on your next trip.",
    "h01.bookerbob.testnet": "bairro alto hotel honors your verified airbnb and world id perks, stacking fully across all three december nights in chiado.",
    "h02.bookerbob.testnet": "five star principe real lisbon honors your verified airbnb frequent status with our deepest discount for those december nights.",
    "h03.bookerbob.testnet": "three december nights at five star lapa palace lisbon, tax included, instant confirmation for verified guests, reserve now",
    "h04.bookerbob.testnet": "valverde lisbon welcomes you this december, three nights of five star serenity, your verified discounts already live on board.",
    "h05.bookerbob.testnet": "five star intercontinental lisbon, december 10 to 13, tax included, every matched discount stacked for a verified returning guest",
    "h06.bookerbob.testnet": "pestana palace lisboa applies your airbnb frequent and world id matches across three december nights, palace gardens breakfast included.",
    "h07.bookerbob.testnet": "the one palacio da anunciada welcomes you dec 10 to 13, airbnb frequent verified, matched discount applied at booking.",
